### Register a new User POST /API/AUTH/REGISTER

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testn@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345678",
  "username": "adfNate"
}


### Login a user POST /API/AUTH/REGISTER

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "newpassword",
  "username": "adfNate"
}


### Get a user profile GET /API/AUTH/ME

GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJhZGZuYXRlIiwiaWF0IjoxNzczOTM1NTAzLCJleHAiOjE3NzQ1NDAzMDN9.S6yCaft7SVG3XTB6iY9S3_C04V8p7mjl7sEbI0NyvTg


### Send a password reset token to the user POST /API/AUTH/FORGOT-PASSWORD

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/forgot-password HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testn@gmail.com"
}


### Verify password reset token GET /API/AUTH/VERIFY-RESET-TOKEN

GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/verify-reset-token HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testn@gmail.com",
  "token": "ee5044da32d4e7cc4eadafc6cab2d98d0cdb5eabfdd10b6f0f9bdb47e76bf838"
}


### Reset a password PUT /API/AUTH/RESET-PASSWORD

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/auth/reset-password HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testn@gmail.com",
  "password": "newpassword",
  "token": "ee5044da32d4e7cc4eadafc6cab2d98d0cdb5eabfdd10b6f0f9bdb47e76bf838"
}


### Search for a book by title to add to shelf GET /API/BOOKS/SEARCH

GET http://localhost:5000/api/books/search?title="The art of war" HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJhZGZuYXRlIiwiaWF0IjoxNzczOTQzNjg5LCJleHAiOjE3NzQ1NDg0ODl9.dprrCLLLXd3Ar1c4YO1kyZhp4L905nTgmzcoehd9aIE


### Add a book to shelf POST /API/BOOKS/ADD

POST http://localhost:5000/api/books/add HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJhZGZuYXRlIiwiaWF0IjoxNzczOTQzNjg5LCJleHAiOjE3NzQ1NDg0ODl9.dprrCLLLXd3Ar1c4YO1kyZhp4L905nTgmzcoehd9aIE

{
  "googleId": "SbR2SVC8bTIC",
  "status": "READING"
}


### Get the books a user has added to his shelf GET /API/BOOKS

GET http://localhost:5000/api/books/?status=READING HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJhZGZuYXRlIiwiaWF0IjoxNzczOTQzNjg5LCJleHAiOjE3NzQ1NDg0ODl9.dprrCLLLXd3Ar1c4YO1kyZhp4L905nTgmzcoehd9aIE


### Get details of a specific book like progress for a specific user GET /API/BOOKS/:id

GET http://localhost:5000/api/books/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJhZGZuYXRlIiwiaWF0IjoxNzczOTQzNjg5LCJleHAiOjE3NzQ1NDg0ODl9.dprrCLLLXd3Ar1c4YO1kyZhp4L905nTgmzcoehd9aIE
